{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のNOGIBINGO!\n初回に引き続き\n収録に参加しちゃってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーマンラッシュアワーの村本さんが\n来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のAKBINGO!面白くて好きだから\n嬉しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっとで始まるよ\n観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中観てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブしてタンバリンして\n乃木團もあって、という夏で\nまあまあ大変でしたが\n合格で良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手だから練習するけど\n下手なせいで\n手に痣ができちゃうし手首も痛くなるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもベースの練習もしたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構、手を酷使したように思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん方が\n湿布やアイシングできるようなものを\n何も言ってないのに買ってきてくれたり\n助けられました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴンゾーさん、\n丁寧にたくさん優しく教えてくださって\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達からさっそく\nカラオケでタンバリンしてくれる？\nって連絡きたよ わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたしめでたしでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/18/1659436/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ちょっとでてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、選抜発表もふれた方がいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くとしたら今回もメールかなー\nそんな書くこと無いからちょっとだけね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}